        "id": 1886547
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T07:59:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is more to do with broadcast side .\n\nUserHandle.SYSTEM : A user handle to indicate the \"system\" user of the device\nUserHandle.ALL : A user handle to indicate all users on the device \n\nSince connectivity is System Service , Do we need UserHandle.All?\n\nUserHandle.SYSTEM is suggested, when your code needs to perform privileged system-level tasks or if the operation targets the core Android system affecting all users.\n\nFor On Role SMS Change for which currently it is being monitored , UserHandle.System should Work fine .",
      "parentUuid": "30e909f5_eb1a6540",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 76,
        "endLine": 72,
        "endChar": 82
      },
      "revId": "506b8e638d342ef9b1f9fab81a8e420c9eb5be58",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
